.TH TESSA-CTL 1 "2026-10-29" "Tessa 0.2.3" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
tessa-ctl \- control a running Tessa compositor
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B tessa-ctl
.I command
.RI [ arguments ...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B tessa-ctl
connects to the running compositor over its Unix socket and sends control,
introspection, or event-subscription commands.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B state [--json]
Print one state snapshot.
.TP
.B config [--json]
Print the effective configuration and diagnostics.
.TP
.B config-check [FILE]
Check the running configuration, or validate FILE without applying it, and
exit non-zero on errors.
.TP
.B config-diff FILE
Print diagnostics and the effective-configuration changes FILE would produce.
.TP
.B config-edit [FILE]
Copy the running config (or FILE) to a temporary file, open it with
.BR $VISUAL / $EDITOR ,
validate and diff it, then write it back and reload after confirmation.
.TP
.B perf [--json] [--reset]
Print render-commit frame-time statistics. The budget is set by
.I frame_time_budget
in the config.
.TP
.B events [topic]
Stream extension events.
.TP
.B rpc JSON
Send one JSON-RPC 2.0 request and print the reply.
.TP
.B dispatch COMMAND
Send a raw compositor command.
.TP
.B workspace N [OUTPUT]
Switch workspace.
.TP
.B special NAME
Toggle a named special workspace.
.TP
.B move-to-special NAME
Move the focused window to a named special workspace.
.TP
.B layout [NAME] [OUTPUT]
Cycle or set the workspace layout.
.TP
.B resize DX DY
Resize the focused floating window.
.TP
.B notify-action ID KEY
Invoke a notification action.
.TP
.B spawn COMMAND...
Start a command.
.TP
.B launcher [QUERY...]
Open the launcher.
.TP
.B panel POPOVER [OUTPUT]
Open a panel popover.
.TP
.B mode [NAME]
Switch or reset the input mode.
.TP
.B status ID TEXT
Set or clear a bar status entry.
.TP
.B quit
Stop the compositor.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B TESSA_IPC
IPC socket path. Defaults to
.IR $XDG_RUNTIME_DIR/tessa.sock .
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR tessa (1)
